  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/426659329/@cloudflare/vitest-plugin@1.9.1</id>
    <updated>2026-11-23T19:24:34Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/releases/tag/%40cloudflare%2Fvitest-plugin%401.9.1"/>
    <title>@cloudflare/vitest-plugin@1.9.1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h3&gt;Patch Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/pull/17070&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/cloudflare/workers-sdk/pull/17070/hovercard&quot;&gt;#17070&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/commit/657179d3d707a244038168675292b288e0a1f4ef&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;657179d&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Thanks &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apps/dependabot&quot;&gt;@dependabot&lt;/a&gt;! - Update &lt;code&gt;DEFAULT_COMPAT_DATE&lt;/code&gt; to 2026-11-23&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use the bundled workerd release&#39;s compatibility date by default when scaffolding new projects or when no compatibility date is configured.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/pull/16879&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/cloudflare/workers-sdk/pull/16879/hovercard&quot;&gt;#16879&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/commit/5970e6a842b36665ab092f54ae276d34b02e3a29&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;5970e6a&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Thanks &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/edmundhung&quot;&gt;@edmundhung&lt;/a&gt;! - Throw from &lt;code&gt;readD1Migrations()&lt;/code&gt; when the migrations directory doesn&#39;t exist&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Passing options with a missing &lt;code&gt;migrationsDir&lt;/code&gt; used to return no migrations, so a typo silently applied nothing. It now throws &quot;No migrations present at …&quot;, as Wrangler does. Passing a directory path that doesn&#39;t exist throws the same error. A migrations directory that can&#39;t be read now also throws when you pass options, and both forms name the directory in the error.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/pull/17108&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/cloudflare/workers-sdk/pull/17108/hovercard&quot;&gt;#17108&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/commit/65f6f33eaad8a4712f915d884bfb4c04a862c516&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;65f6f33&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Thanks &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Hebilicious&quot;&gt;@Hebilicious&lt;/a&gt;! - Resolve the runner&#39;s &lt;code&gt;vitest/worker&lt;/code&gt; import from the plugin, not from the project root&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The runner is a virtual module, &lt;code&gt;/index.mjs&lt;/code&gt;, so Vite resolved its &lt;code&gt;vitest/worker&lt;/code&gt; import from the project root. When the root could not resolve &lt;code&gt;vitest&lt;/code&gt;, as in a pnpm workspace whose root package does not depend on it, no test file ran and Workers threw &lt;code&gt;No such module &quot;vitest/worker&quot;&lt;/code&gt;. When a parent directory had another &lt;code&gt;vitest&lt;/code&gt; version, the runner loaded that version and Vitest failed to find the runner. The plugin now resolves &lt;code&gt;vitest/worker&lt;/code&gt; from its own package, so the runner uses the same Vitest as the pool.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Updated dependencies [&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/commit/657179d3d707a244038168675292b288e0a1f4ef&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;657179d&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/commit/657179d3d707a244038168675292b288e0a1f4ef&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;657179d&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/commit/7afc49c652d8be84e4f7a6d3673145340e37a685&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;7afc49c&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/commit/086706dfec2238540e8170d69fd9481c547f306d&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;086706d&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/commit/5b45f32b75e40540f6be934978e48b2cd816ed42&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;5b45f32&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/commit/00413bbb0decc8d3282a7bc5259d629614e66876&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;00413bb&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/commit/5bc7dba8e4d2b9254b48d3c4d3ef2df23a918637&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;5bc7dba&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/commit/086706dfec2238540e8170d69fd9481c547f306d&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;086706d&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;]:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:miniflare@5.20261123.0-beta&quot;&gt;miniflare@5.20261123.0-beta&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
